.TH WORDCRAFT 1 "2026" "WordCraft" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
wordcraft \- open-source, native word processor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wordcraft
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIFILE\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
WordCraft is a fast, open-source word processor with the Word workflow:
ribbon, styles, tables, track changes, references and mail merge.
It reads and writes .docx and also opens .odt, .rtf, .html, .md and .txt,
and exports PDF.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-sample
Open with the sample document.
.TP
.B \-\-control PORT
Expose the control channel on 127.0.0.1:PORT (see
/usr/share/doc/wordcraft/README.md and the control protocol).
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-help, \-h
Print help and exit.
.SH FILES
.I ~/.config/wordcraft/
.RS
Preferences, logs and control-channel key files.
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR wordcraft-cli (1)
